WEBVTT

01:48.400 --> 01:49.240
Miss.

01:49.720 --> 01:51.440
What did Duke Su want from you today?

01:52.080 --> 01:54.400
Maybe he can't accept that I used him

01:54.920 --> 01:56.120
to return to the Jiang family.

01:57.560 --> 01:58.800
He tested me today

01:59.360 --> 02:01.200
probably because he suspects
my true identity.

02:02.240 --> 02:03.600
Will you be in danger, miss?

02:04.080 --> 02:05.160
No worries.

02:05.240 --> 02:07.040
I've already made things clear.

02:07.520 --> 02:09.160
Let's just avoid
offending him in the future.

02:13.080 --> 02:14.720
No matter what happens,

02:15.280 --> 02:17.200
don't pawn this jade pendant again.

02:17.960 --> 02:20.120
No one is worth giving up
this pendant again.

02:31.280 --> 02:33.200
My lady, Jiang Yu'e wants to see you.

02:35.400 --> 02:36.720
She's already here.

02:41.720 --> 02:42.600
Jiang Li.

02:44.480 --> 02:46.640
This is Jiang Yu'e,
the third concubine's only daughter,

02:46.720 --> 02:48.000
who likes throwing her weight around.

02:48.080 --> 02:50.120
She has been
Jiang Ruoyao's lackey since childhood.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.720
This is a music score from Ruoyao.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.560
She's also inviting you to the courtyard.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.320
RUI FAMILY'S SECRET MUSIC SCORE

03:02.400 --> 03:03.760
How deliberate of you.

03:05.640 --> 03:07.920
The Jiang Residence
has really become undisciplined.

03:08.560 --> 03:10.720
Even a maid dares to scold the master.

03:11.480 --> 03:13.760
Yu'e, you're indeed well-mannered,

03:15.080 --> 03:17.520
coming to your sister's place
to reprimand the maid.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.400
Tong'er.

03:19.480 --> 03:21.160
The music score is dirty. Burn it.

03:21.720 --> 03:22.560
Yes.

03:32.480 --> 03:33.320
How insolent!

03:34.320 --> 03:35.280
You're impetuous!

03:37.560 --> 03:38.960
You're insolent!

03:42.000 --> 03:43.200
Yu'e, you are precious.

03:43.800 --> 03:46.520
Please take your filth with you.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.680
It's wasted here.

03:50.120 --> 03:52.080
No good deed goes unpunished.

03:52.160 --> 03:53.760
I've delivered Ruoyao's message.

03:53.840 --> 03:55.120
Do as you see fit.

03:58.920 --> 04:00.440
She's still the same when she was kid,

04:00.520 --> 04:02.520
bullying the weak, fearing the strong,
like a dog relying on its master's power.

04:02.600 --> 04:03.680
As if!

04:04.520 --> 04:05.600
Woof!

04:09.520 --> 04:14.280
It seems like
I should meet Ms. Jiang Ruoyao.

04:48.160 --> 04:49.000
Nice song.

04:56.800 --> 04:57.760
Jiang Li.

04:58.320 --> 05:00.640
I suppose you are Ruoyao.

05:01.200 --> 05:05.000
It's a pity that
such a beautiful melody was interrupted.

05:05.600 --> 05:08.480
You've spent years in Zhennv Hall.
Do you know music too?

05:09.080 --> 05:11.040
I only learned a bit there.

05:11.120 --> 05:11.960
It's nothing much.

05:13.960 --> 05:15.840
This guqin originally wasn't mine.

05:16.520 --> 05:17.840
Last time, I passed by a tea house

05:17.920 --> 05:19.320
and heard a singer playing it.

05:20.200 --> 05:21.520
It's a good guqin,

05:21.600 --> 05:23.280
but the singer played it poorly

05:23.360 --> 05:24.560
and wasted it.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.840
I just took it to play with it.

05:26.920 --> 05:27.960
Now that it's broken,

05:28.040 --> 05:29.040
it should be thrown away.

05:35.560 --> 05:38.000
Just the string is broken.
There's no need to throw it away.

05:56.760 --> 06:00.480
If something is mine, it's mine.

06:01.440 --> 06:02.720
Even if I don't want it,

06:03.520 --> 06:04.880
others can't take it.

06:05.440 --> 06:08.840
How do you know that others will want

06:09.600 --> 06:10.840
what you don't want?

06:11.400 --> 06:12.480
It's best if they don't.

06:12.960 --> 06:15.040
Otherwise, they won't end up well.

06:16.080 --> 06:19.240
Jiang Li, you must be over 15, right?

06:19.320 --> 06:22.480
Tomorrow is my Hairpin Ceremony.
Jiang Li, you must come.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.040
Of course.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.920
I will definitely bring a gift.

06:41.360 --> 06:42.200
Jinhua.

06:43.400 --> 06:44.240
My lady.

06:44.840 --> 06:47.640
Bring out my best clothes and jewelry.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.400
At tomorrow's Hairpin Ceremony,

06:49.880 --> 06:51.280
I want her to see

06:51.360 --> 06:54.040
how a true Jiang family lady should be.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.600
Yes.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.800
Is Ruoyao asleep?

07:00.640 --> 07:01.720
Not yet.

07:02.320 --> 07:03.320
I asked Jinhua.

07:03.840 --> 07:06.280
She said that Ms. Ruoyao
opened her wardrobe

07:06.360 --> 07:07.520
and tried on different clothes

07:07.600 --> 07:09.240
and jewelry repeatedly.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.560
She's too busy to sleep.

07:12.320 --> 07:14.800
The daughters of the Jiang family
are all beautiful.

07:15.320 --> 07:17.280
But no matter how good
the clothes and jewelry are,

07:17.360 --> 07:19.440
who can they outshine
at the Hairpin Ceremony?

07:20.240 --> 07:22.640
Ms. Ruoyao is still young

07:22.720 --> 07:23.840
and naive.

07:26.520 --> 07:29.520
We must think more for her then.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.800
I will ensure
Ms. Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony

07:32.880 --> 07:33.720
is perfect.

07:40.560 --> 07:41.560
Ms. Jiang Li.

07:43.440 --> 07:46.120
This is a beauty-keeping soup
especially prepared by the kitchen.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.840
Madam Ji sent it to nourish your body.

07:49.400 --> 07:52.480
After drinking this soup,
you'll be prettier.

08:05.040 --> 08:05.920
Anything else?

08:06.000 --> 08:07.200
Ms. Jiang Li.

08:07.280 --> 08:10.440
You need to drink the soup
while it's warm to become beautiful.

08:11.720 --> 08:14.200
I'll drink it once you leave.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.200
All right.

08:39.760 --> 08:40.679
Tong'er.

08:43.159 --> 08:44.039
Miss.

08:46.160 --> 08:47.200
The silver needle.

08:47.680 --> 08:48.520
The silver needle?

08:55.520 --> 08:57.120
This is serious.

08:57.640 --> 08:59.720
I'll report this
to Old Madam and his lordship now.

08:59.800 --> 09:01.880
It must be Ji Shuran's doing.

09:01.960 --> 09:03.040
Although there is evidence,

09:03.600 --> 09:04.840
who would dare to be the witness

09:04.920 --> 09:06.160
that would cost her life?

09:06.800 --> 09:07.760
Then what should we do?

09:08.240 --> 09:09.680
What if this is meant to kill you?

09:09.760 --> 09:12.000
If I die in Jiang Residence,

09:12.080 --> 09:14.920
Ji Shuran must show up
and kneel at the government office.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.680
It's unlikely that she'd kill me.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.800
This poison is probably

09:18.880 --> 09:20.880
just to keep me
from attending the Hairpin Ceremony.

09:26.000 --> 09:26.840
Tong'er.

09:36.840 --> 09:39.880
This beauty soup is really delicious.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.440
My, Xiangqiao!

09:51.520 --> 09:52.400
Are you all right?

09:53.680 --> 09:54.520
I…

10:10.320 --> 10:11.240
I'm fine.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.440
I'm…

10:12.520 --> 10:14.440
waiting to collect the bowl
from Ms. Jiang Li.

10:24.440 --> 10:26.760
Ms. Jiang Li, did you drink it all?

10:28.360 --> 10:31.280
This beauty soup is really delicious.

10:31.360 --> 10:32.240
Ms. Jiang Li,

10:32.320 --> 10:34.400
you've become so beautiful
in such a short time.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.560
I think so too.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.480
You drank it all.

10:40.320 --> 10:41.160
You look so pretty!

10:50.000 --> 10:50.880
Tong'er.

10:50.960 --> 10:51.840
Come with me

10:52.400 --> 10:53.360
to find a way out.

10:56.880 --> 10:57.720
Madam Ji.

10:59.920 --> 11:01.160
Just as you expected,

11:01.680 --> 11:03.480
Jiang Li pretended to drink a few sips,

11:03.560 --> 11:05.080
then secretly poured it out.

11:05.160 --> 11:08.000
This girl is so scheming.

11:08.640 --> 11:12.120
She endured living
in Zhennv Hall for so long.

11:12.200 --> 11:14.240
She should have some ability to cope.

11:14.320 --> 11:17.120
This was done to lower her guard.

11:17.200 --> 11:19.840
Do as I said for the next step.

11:22.400 --> 11:24.520
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW

11:25.440 --> 11:26.440
The deadline has passed.

11:26.920 --> 11:29.400
If you still won't let me go,
don't blame me for going after you!

11:35.960 --> 11:36.880
What are these?

11:38.360 --> 11:39.200
Those aren't mine.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.360
Burn them.

11:53.320 --> 11:54.600
So much fun.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.320
This is so fun.

11:57.400 --> 11:58.240
You…

12:02.840 --> 12:05.000
Those are all money.

12:05.080 --> 12:07.080
It's not yours. Why are you making a fuss?

12:08.520 --> 12:09.400
I just…

12:10.600 --> 12:12.200
Who wouldn't feel bad
seeing money being burned?

12:12.280 --> 12:13.480
I don't feel bad.

12:15.320 --> 12:16.320
I don't run a casino

12:16.400 --> 12:17.640
or a brothel,

12:17.720 --> 12:18.720
unlike you.

12:19.920 --> 12:21.120
What's wrong, Mr. Qin?

12:21.720 --> 12:23.400
After being here for the past few days,

12:24.680 --> 12:26.560
your accounts are showing no income.

12:27.120 --> 12:28.600
Are your businesses about to collapse?

12:29.160 --> 12:30.000
No.

12:30.560 --> 12:34.840
I can catch every single one
of your private salt traffickers.

12:35.640 --> 12:37.080
After hitting them for a while,

12:37.960 --> 12:40.920
someone will get scared
and tell the truth.

12:41.920 --> 12:43.760
But I don't want
to go through the trouble.

12:43.840 --> 12:45.280
Mr. Qin,

12:46.560 --> 12:48.440
if you're willing to save me the trouble,

12:48.520 --> 12:49.400
I promise you

12:51.080 --> 12:51.920
that I'll return

12:52.400 --> 12:53.240
your money.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.880
I'll set you free too. How about it?

13:01.320 --> 13:03.360
It seems you're not willing
to help me with this.

13:04.560 --> 13:05.600
Then forget it.

13:07.320 --> 13:08.920
I won't bother asking anymore.

13:09.480 --> 13:10.400
You can just wait

13:11.560 --> 13:13.160
for your last meal.

13:14.720 --> 13:15.560
Wen Ji.

13:16.040 --> 13:18.160
Seal his shackles.
It's troublesome to leave them open.

13:18.840 --> 13:19.680
Wait.

13:22.040 --> 13:23.600
I split the salt trafficking money 50-50

13:24.240 --> 13:25.840
with Yang Song

13:27.320 --> 13:28.720
from the Bureau of Salt and Iron.

13:32.280 --> 13:33.640
Are you really going to let him go?

13:33.720 --> 13:34.920
What if he's lying?

13:35.760 --> 13:38.160
If he was, he wouldn't dare
implicate the Bureau of Salt and Iron.

13:38.840 --> 13:40.000
According to the secret guard,

13:40.080 --> 13:42.680
Yang Song went to the local office
of the Bureau of Salt and Iron

13:42.760 --> 13:43.920
and was on his way back.

13:44.000 --> 13:44.840
Keep a close watch.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.560
As soon as he returns, arrest him at once.

13:46.640 --> 13:47.480
Yes.

13:48.880 --> 13:52.000
Tomorrow, I'll take a day off
to watch Little Taohong's performance.

13:52.080 --> 13:54.320
My lord, Taohong
won't be performing tomorrow.

13:54.400 --> 13:55.320
Why?

13:55.400 --> 13:56.920
At Ms. Jiang Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony,

13:57.000 --> 13:58.960
Ji Yanlin invited
Taohong's troupe to perform.

13:59.040 --> 14:01.520
I didn't tell you earlier
because you've been with Mr. Qin.

14:02.200 --> 14:05.360
Is Shen Yurong on the guest list?

14:09.360 --> 14:11.520
That'll be more interesting to watch
than a performance.

14:13.880 --> 14:17.560
JIANG RESIDENCE, AUSPICIOUS

14:30.640 --> 14:31.560
Dear.

14:33.120 --> 14:34.200
Tell her

14:34.280 --> 14:36.200
to hurry up and get dressed.

14:36.760 --> 14:38.120
If she can make it, fine.

14:38.200 --> 14:40.280
If not, she shouldn't come out.

14:40.360 --> 14:41.480
All right.

14:52.640 --> 14:53.520
Madam Li.

14:54.680 --> 14:57.040
Isn't this Taohong,
the famous actress from the capital?

14:57.120 --> 14:59.520
Yes. A chance to see
her performance is rare.

14:59.600 --> 15:02.320
- We're in for a treat today.
- Duke Sun.

15:02.400 --> 15:03.800
- Duke Liu.
- This way, please.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.680
Chancellor, it is an honor to attend

15:05.760 --> 15:08.000
Ms. Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony.

15:08.920 --> 15:09.800
Thank you for coming.

15:16.440 --> 15:17.440
Chancellor.

15:17.520 --> 15:18.520
Mrs. Jiang.

15:19.120 --> 15:20.120
We're late.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.360
MARQUIS OF NINGYUAN

15:24.560 --> 15:26.600
You're personally presenting the gift.

15:26.680 --> 15:28.800
My daughter will surely be delighted.

15:28.880 --> 15:30.400
I'm already engaged to Ruoyao.

15:30.960 --> 15:33.520
Today is her Hairpin Ceremony.
I must bring a gift.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.840
This way, please.

15:39.640 --> 15:41.960
Madam Ji, today…

15:42.040 --> 15:43.320
So many of you are here.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.240
Chancellor Jiang.

15:46.320 --> 15:47.200
Mrs. Jiang.

15:49.680 --> 15:50.520
Wait.

15:51.520 --> 15:52.520
Where is Ms. Jiang Li?

15:53.080 --> 15:55.040
I brought her a gift.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.440
Mrs. Liu,

15:56.520 --> 15:58.040
I will accept it on Li'er's behalf.

15:58.520 --> 15:59.360
There's no need.

15:59.440 --> 16:01.280
I want to give it to her personally.

16:02.960 --> 16:05.440
She has suffered in the past

16:05.520 --> 16:07.720
and is still a bit scared.

16:07.800 --> 16:10.360
I'm also worried today's event
might overwhelm her,

16:10.440 --> 16:11.680
so I let her rest.

16:11.760 --> 16:14.440
Ms. Jiang Li hasn't been back
in the capital for a long time.

16:14.520 --> 16:16.640
She must have forgotten
the rules she learned.

16:19.080 --> 16:21.040
She was already difficult
to discipline as a child.

16:21.600 --> 16:23.840
Madam Ji spent a lot of time on her.

16:24.800 --> 16:25.640
Indeed.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.320
Someone initially educated her,

16:27.400 --> 16:30.840
but she was later abandoned
in Zhennv Hall for more than ten years.

16:31.640 --> 16:32.920
Forget about etiquette.

16:33.000 --> 16:36.080
It's a miracle she's alive and back.

16:36.160 --> 16:37.240
Right?

16:37.840 --> 16:39.720
She should be punished
for forgetting the rules,

16:39.800 --> 16:41.520
but what about those

16:41.600 --> 16:42.520
who forgot her?

16:43.080 --> 16:44.360
No parent

16:44.960 --> 16:47.960
wants to see their child suffer.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.920
When I lost my child,

16:52.000 --> 16:53.400
I was heartbroken too,

16:54.080 --> 16:56.080
so I let my husband handle the situation.

16:56.160 --> 16:57.800
When I realized it,

16:58.400 --> 17:00.240
my heart ached terribly.

17:01.840 --> 17:02.920
Mrs. Liu, rest assured.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.440
Now that Li'er is back,

17:05.040 --> 17:07.359
I will certainly make it up to her.

17:07.440 --> 17:08.599
You are

17:08.680 --> 17:10.560
too kindhearted.

17:11.079 --> 17:12.000
Mrs. Liu.

17:12.839 --> 17:14.599
Jiang Li's suffering in Zhennv Hall

17:14.680 --> 17:16.280
wasn't anyone's intention.

17:16.359 --> 17:17.599
However, don't forget

17:17.680 --> 17:20.200
why she ended up there.

17:20.760 --> 17:23.520
- If it weren't for--
- Today is Yao'er's Hairpin Ceremony.

17:23.599 --> 17:25.000
Let's not bring up the past anymore.

17:27.800 --> 17:28.640
Mrs. Liu.

17:34.400 --> 17:35.480
Mrs. Liu, this way.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.600
- Mrs. Liu.
- Everyone is here.

17:39.160 --> 17:41.600
- Madam Wang.
- Mrs. Liu, we've been waiting for you.

18:00.200 --> 18:01.040
Tong'er.

18:02.120 --> 18:03.120
Tong'er!

18:12.280 --> 18:13.120
Oh no.

18:14.640 --> 18:15.480
Tong'er.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.040
Tong'er.

18:19.800 --> 18:20.760
Tong'er.

18:21.320 --> 18:23.120
Wake up.

18:24.440 --> 18:26.720
Miss, I dreamed someone
was pinching my face.

18:26.800 --> 18:28.000
Wake up.

18:28.080 --> 18:29.840
Miss, why are you up so early?

18:31.240 --> 18:32.480
It's not early.

18:32.560 --> 18:33.600
We overslept.

18:34.520 --> 18:35.400
We overslept?

18:36.040 --> 18:37.720
Has the Hairpin Ceremony already started?

18:37.800 --> 18:39.240
We couldn't have both overslept.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.360
They must have done something to us.

18:41.920 --> 18:44.160
But miss,
didn't we already dodge it yesterday?

18:45.040 --> 18:45.880
I was careless.

18:46.600 --> 18:48.360
The soup was a diversion.

19:08.400 --> 19:09.480
Never mind that first.

19:09.560 --> 19:11.680
- Quick. Get me dressed.
- Yes.

19:16.560 --> 19:17.480
Yuanbai.

19:17.560 --> 19:19.000
Congratulations.

19:19.080 --> 19:20.080
Father.

19:21.560 --> 19:24.800
This is a gift from Consort Li.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.400
It's a reward from His Majesty.

19:26.480 --> 19:28.040
I couldn't refuse,

19:28.120 --> 19:29.240
so I brought it here.

19:30.520 --> 19:31.360
As you know,

19:31.440 --> 19:33.120
although she became a consort,

19:33.680 --> 19:37.440
she's still the youngest in our family
and very close to us.

19:37.520 --> 19:39.040
Consort Li is also giving attention

19:39.120 --> 19:41.160
to Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony.

19:41.960 --> 19:44.240
Father, you and Consort Li
are very thoughtful.

19:44.800 --> 19:47.040
Her gift is too precious.

19:47.600 --> 19:48.440
We cannot accept it.

19:48.520 --> 19:50.040
We're all a family.

19:50.760 --> 19:51.600
Shuran.

19:52.200 --> 19:53.040
Accept it.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.600
- Take it.
- Yes, Father.

19:57.680 --> 19:59.040
I am retiring soon.

19:59.880 --> 20:01.720
Our families' honor
and disgrace are shared.

20:01.800 --> 20:04.880
You've met Shuran's cousin, right?

20:05.440 --> 20:06.520
Think about it

20:06.600 --> 20:09.040
and mention him to His Majesty.

20:09.120 --> 20:09.960
Father,

20:10.960 --> 20:12.840
why are you bringing this up again?

20:13.400 --> 20:14.800
Appointing people based on kinship

20:14.880 --> 20:16.520
won't sound good.

20:17.920 --> 20:20.040
His Majesty follows law and justice.

20:20.120 --> 20:22.880
It's not something that'll be decided
by my husband's words.

20:26.560 --> 20:27.920
I got it.

20:28.600 --> 20:30.440
Today is Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony.

20:31.280 --> 20:32.520
It's not a good time to discuss.

20:33.280 --> 20:35.000
We can talk about it another day.

20:37.920 --> 20:38.800
Fine.

20:39.760 --> 20:41.600
We'll do as you say, Yuanbai.

20:42.200 --> 20:43.120
I'll go in first then.

20:45.960 --> 20:47.200
Duke Ji, this way, please.

20:54.360 --> 20:55.560
Greetings, Chancellor Jiang,

20:56.320 --> 20:57.160
Mrs. Jiang.

20:58.360 --> 21:00.560
Mr. Shen, you're so courteous.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.160
I was saying

21:03.240 --> 21:05.440
that Mr. Shen should visit often

21:06.160 --> 21:07.560
to guide Ruoyao.

21:08.280 --> 21:09.560
Thank you, Mrs. Jiang.

21:26.760 --> 21:28.480
As expected of the Chief Secretariat.

21:28.560 --> 21:30.320
His residence is much grander than ours.

21:31.520 --> 21:33.360
Don't be fooled
by their plain appearances.

21:33.840 --> 21:35.920
I heard that everyone present

21:36.000 --> 21:37.880
is at least of the third rank.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.880
If you fancy anyone,
let your brother know.

21:42.440 --> 21:43.280
Mother.

21:44.680 --> 21:46.000
None of them are young.

21:46.560 --> 21:47.800
Old ones are affectionate.

21:49.080 --> 21:50.200
- Give it to me.
- All right.

22:15.840 --> 22:16.920
This is outrageous.

22:17.000 --> 22:18.480
They even sent people to guard us.

22:19.120 --> 22:20.200
I'm going to make a scene.

22:22.720 --> 22:24.800
If you do that now,
the whole city will laugh at us.

22:25.440 --> 22:27.800
If the Jiang family is embarrassed,
you'll be humiliated too.

22:30.400 --> 22:32.200
Ji Shuran is truly ruthless.

22:33.280 --> 22:34.360
What should we do now?

22:34.920 --> 22:37.240
I hope the big gift I sent yesterday

22:37.320 --> 22:38.280
wasn't in vain.

22:39.160 --> 22:41.040
Jiang Yuanbai is so cunning.

22:41.120 --> 22:42.680
Even if he married you,

22:42.760 --> 22:43.640
he remains indifferent

22:43.720 --> 22:45.040
to the Ji family's affairs.

22:45.120 --> 22:47.040
You are also incompetent.

22:47.120 --> 22:49.080
After marrying
into the Jiang family for so long,

22:49.160 --> 22:51.320
you're not making any plans
for our family.

22:51.400 --> 22:53.680
Was he the one you wanted me
to marry back then?

22:54.200 --> 22:55.440
Now, you see

22:55.960 --> 22:57.680
he's rising smoothly

22:57.760 --> 22:58.880
and you want to exploit him.

22:59.440 --> 23:01.040
Don't speak so harshly.

23:01.120 --> 23:02.120
Remember.

23:02.200 --> 23:03.680
You're part of the Ji family,

23:03.760 --> 23:05.920
so you must always consider
our family's benefits.

23:10.880 --> 23:12.520
- Duke Su.
- Duke Su.

23:12.600 --> 23:13.640
- Why is he here?
- Yes.

23:17.440 --> 23:19.000
Why is Duke Su here?

23:19.600 --> 23:21.200
It's not a friendly visit.

23:21.280 --> 23:22.640
He comes with blades too.

23:22.720 --> 23:24.440
Something big must be happening.

23:39.200 --> 23:42.720
Duke Su, are you here
on official business?

23:42.800 --> 23:44.400
You must be joking, Chancellor Jiang.

23:44.480 --> 23:45.800
I have no official business today.

23:46.640 --> 23:47.880
You have a lot of prestige.

23:47.960 --> 23:50.520
Even Little Taohong canceled
my reserved performance.

23:50.600 --> 23:51.600
I could only come here

23:51.680 --> 23:53.680
to join the fun.

23:54.720 --> 23:56.320
Chancellor Jiang, you don't mind, do you?

23:56.400 --> 23:57.840
In that case,

23:57.920 --> 23:59.600
Duke Su, help yourself.

24:01.600 --> 24:03.160
Where is Ms. Jiang Li?

24:03.880 --> 24:04.760
Duke Su.

24:05.320 --> 24:06.880
Li'er is feeling unwell today

24:06.960 --> 24:08.040
and resting in her room.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.160
Chancellor Jiang.

24:13.360 --> 24:15.720
I even gave half
of my ceremonial weapons to Ms. Jiang Li.

24:16.280 --> 24:17.600
Out of courtesy,

24:17.680 --> 24:19.800
she should come out today to thank me.

24:19.880 --> 24:21.400
Indeed, it is disrespectful.

24:21.480 --> 24:23.000
In that case,

24:23.080 --> 24:24.800
I'll send someone to check on her again.

24:28.200 --> 24:29.200
Duke Su.

24:29.960 --> 24:30.840
Help yourself.

24:33.840 --> 24:34.960
Investigate.

24:35.040 --> 24:35.880
Yes.

25:02.400 --> 25:05.480
Nice, "Ruoyao is 15 now

25:05.560 --> 25:07.600
and virtuous talents offer their praise.

25:07.680 --> 25:09.880
The azure bird flies not alone,

25:09.960 --> 25:12.480
for she has found someone
to hold her hand."

25:15.960 --> 25:19.120
- Ms. Jiang Ruoyao and Mr. Zhou
- Ms. Jiang Ruoyao and Mr. Zhou

25:19.200 --> 25:21.160
- make a wonderful couple.
- make a wonderful couple.

25:21.760 --> 25:24.280
Today is Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony.

25:25.120 --> 25:28.560
Thank you all for coming.

25:34.880 --> 25:35.840
Where have you been?

25:35.920 --> 25:37.280
I had a stomach ache.

25:37.880 --> 25:38.720
Where's my father?

25:38.800 --> 25:42.560
We have a beauty in Jiang Residence,

25:42.640 --> 25:45.800
peerless and independent.

25:45.880 --> 25:48.920
Like a lotus emerging from clear water,

25:49.000 --> 25:51.680
she's naturally adorned.

25:52.160 --> 25:54.640
Her hands are delicate

25:55.320 --> 25:57.080
and her skin is as smooth as cream.

25:57.160 --> 25:59.280
I found her.
Two people are guarding the door.

25:59.360 --> 26:00.600
She probably can't come out.

26:02.120 --> 26:03.960
I knew she was not one to avoid crowds.

26:04.760 --> 26:06.120
Apparently, she is locked up.

26:06.760 --> 26:08.040
Do you want me to go and…

26:08.120 --> 26:08.960
There's no need.

26:09.800 --> 26:11.520
The Jiang family
is full of mixed characters,

26:11.600 --> 26:12.880
but she insists on returning.

26:13.480 --> 26:14.840
Now, we can see

26:15.360 --> 26:18.680
how much she wants to show herself.

26:19.520 --> 26:21.400
The auspicious time has come.

26:21.480 --> 26:24.800
The Hairpin Ceremony begins!

26:25.920 --> 26:26.800
Dear.

26:46.040 --> 26:48.840
Honoree, get into position.

27:26.800 --> 27:28.160
A talented man and a pretty woman.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.680
What a perfect match!

27:30.240 --> 27:31.480
A gifted scholar

27:31.560 --> 27:33.240
and a beautiful lady.

27:33.320 --> 27:35.080
A match made in heaven

27:35.160 --> 27:37.000
- and earth.
- And earth.

27:37.800 --> 27:41.840
Next, Mrs. Jiang will dress the honoree

27:41.920 --> 27:44.960
and place the ceremonial hairpin.

27:58.920 --> 28:00.600
In this auspicious month and day,

28:00.680 --> 28:02.360
you begin to wear your first adult attire.

28:03.440 --> 28:05.360
Leave behind your childish pursuits

28:05.440 --> 28:07.280
and follow the path of virtue.

28:07.880 --> 28:09.560
May you enjoy long life and good fortune

28:09.640 --> 28:11.800
and receive abundant blessings.

28:51.520 --> 28:52.680
The ceremony is complete!

28:52.760 --> 28:54.160
Bow in thanks.

28:54.880 --> 28:56.400
Wonderful!

28:56.480 --> 28:57.960
Nice!

28:58.480 --> 29:01.120
Mrs. Zhou, you're truly fortunate.

29:01.760 --> 29:03.520
You'll gain

29:03.600 --> 29:05.840
such a talented
and graceful daughter-in-law.

29:05.920 --> 29:07.520
I'm lucky.

29:09.520 --> 29:10.880
I'm also lucky to be able

29:11.360 --> 29:12.720
to marry Ruoyao.

29:14.720 --> 29:16.480
Fireworks!

29:20.720 --> 29:21.560
Well…

29:21.640 --> 29:23.480
- Where are the fireworks?
- Where is it?

29:23.560 --> 29:24.560
What happened?

29:27.760 --> 29:28.600
Where are the fireworks?

29:28.680 --> 29:29.520
- There's none.
- No fireworks.

29:29.600 --> 29:31.440
Did they save money for fireworks?

29:33.240 --> 29:34.200
Where are the fireworks?

29:34.280 --> 29:35.360
The fire… Fireworks…

29:35.440 --> 29:37.320
My lord!

29:37.840 --> 29:38.680
The fireworks…

29:38.760 --> 29:40.640
They didn't go off.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.880
They didn't go off?

29:42.840 --> 29:43.920
They didn't go off?

29:44.920 --> 29:46.080
Resolve this!

29:57.320 --> 29:59.280
Such beautiful flowers.

30:02.320 --> 30:03.200
Isn't this beautiful?

30:17.880 --> 30:20.120
Who is that? She's so elegant and refined.

30:20.600 --> 30:21.600
Isn't she

30:21.680 --> 30:24.400
Ms. Jiang Li,
who just returned from Zhennv Hall?

30:25.720 --> 30:28.480
She's the one
who tried to kill her mother and brother.

30:29.160 --> 30:30.880
Is this Ms. Jiang Li?

30:30.960 --> 30:32.360
Yes, it's her.

31:00.720 --> 31:01.680
Mother.

31:01.760 --> 31:02.800
A ghost.

31:29.200 --> 31:30.160
Mother.

31:30.680 --> 31:31.680
It's Xue Fangfei.

31:32.760 --> 31:33.720
It's her.

31:33.800 --> 31:34.960
Mother, it's her.

31:36.520 --> 31:37.400
Mother.

31:38.960 --> 31:40.800
Mother, she's back for revenge.

31:40.880 --> 31:42.160
Shut up.

31:46.600 --> 31:47.520
Ruoyao.

31:48.280 --> 31:49.320
Here's a small gift

31:49.400 --> 31:51.040
for your 15th birthday.

31:51.640 --> 31:54.360
Li'er, you finally made it.

31:54.440 --> 31:56.040
Why are you so late?

31:56.120 --> 31:58.000
I'm not yet familiar
with the residence's layout,

31:58.920 --> 32:00.160
so I was delayed a bit.

32:01.360 --> 32:02.280
Fortunately,

32:02.360 --> 32:04.280
I made it in time
for Ruoyao's Hairpin Ceremony.

32:08.680 --> 32:10.440
Allow me to introduce her.

32:11.840 --> 32:15.920
This is my second daughter
who has just returned,

32:16.000 --> 32:16.960
Jiang Li.

32:17.880 --> 32:19.720
Chancellor Jiang has
acknowledged his daughter.

32:19.800 --> 32:22.320
Don't mention her attempt
to kill her mother and brother anymore.

32:22.400 --> 32:23.360
Yes.

32:23.840 --> 32:24.680
Mother.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.280
Mother, isn't she my sister-in-law?

32:27.880 --> 32:30.560
How can someone

32:30.640 --> 32:32.200
look identical to her in this world?

32:35.240 --> 32:37.640
As expected
of the Chief Secretariat's daughter.

32:37.720 --> 32:39.520
Despite being away for many years,

32:39.600 --> 32:41.120
her every move

32:41.640 --> 32:43.720
is still elegant and dignified.

32:43.800 --> 32:46.880
Chancellor Jiang is truly fortunate.

32:48.400 --> 32:50.080
Mrs. Liu, you flatter us.

32:51.560 --> 32:52.680
Every parent

32:53.520 --> 32:55.600
is concerned for their children.

32:56.880 --> 32:58.000
I know

32:58.080 --> 33:00.720
my father had been very worried about me.

33:01.960 --> 33:04.040
That is why he brought me home.

33:07.160 --> 33:09.400
Seeing you today

33:09.480 --> 33:11.360
makes me feel sentimental.

33:12.240 --> 33:14.160
During all these years you have been away,

33:14.240 --> 33:15.960
I have never seen your Hairpin Ceremony.

33:16.600 --> 33:19.240
Who dressed your hair back then?

33:20.200 --> 33:22.800
In the humble conditions
of Qingcheng Mountain,

33:23.760 --> 33:25.320
I never had a Hairpin Ceremony.

33:26.600 --> 33:29.840
So Mrs. Jiang didn't even visit Li'er

33:29.920 --> 33:32.360
when she was 15.

33:34.000 --> 33:36.560
She never visited even once in ten years?
Jiang Li is so pitiful.

33:36.640 --> 33:39.040
A chancellor's daughter
didn't even have a Hairpin Ceremony.

33:39.120 --> 33:40.880
- That's inexcusable.
- Mrs. Jiang shouldn't have done that.

33:40.960 --> 33:42.680
Mother had been busy
with household matters.

33:42.760 --> 33:44.640
If she had overworked herself for me,

33:45.240 --> 33:46.720
I would have felt guilty.

33:47.600 --> 33:48.880
Today is not too late.

33:48.960 --> 33:50.160
You're not yet 20.

33:50.240 --> 33:51.520
Here.

33:51.600 --> 33:52.560
This

33:53.040 --> 33:54.320
is a hairpin.

33:55.360 --> 33:56.400
As ancient people say,

33:56.480 --> 33:58.680
a hairpin symbolizes adulthood.

33:59.320 --> 34:00.160
Today,

34:00.240 --> 34:01.800
I'll give it to you

34:02.360 --> 34:04.720
to make up
for the Hairpin Ceremony you missed.

34:05.640 --> 34:06.840
Come. I'll put it on your hair.

34:09.679 --> 34:11.159
Mrs. Liu, thank you for your kindness.

34:12.080 --> 34:14.600
But with my mother present,

34:15.560 --> 34:16.840
I dare not accept your gift.

34:18.159 --> 34:19.520
How silly of me.

34:20.239 --> 34:22.360
Mrs. Jiang is still here.

34:23.080 --> 34:24.800
Come on, Mrs. Jiang.

34:24.880 --> 34:26.159
You should be the one

34:26.239 --> 34:27.239
giving her the hairpin.

34:37.239 --> 34:38.080
Li'er.

34:38.600 --> 34:40.560
I will adorn your hair.

34:45.400 --> 34:47.040
Thank you, Mother.

34:53.920 --> 34:55.080
Please bring it

34:56.400 --> 34:57.720
to see my father.

35:04.480 --> 35:05.360
Tell him

35:06.800 --> 35:11.400
I'm suffering greatly
and filled with resentment here,

35:12.960 --> 35:14.280
but I've done nothing wrong.

35:15.560 --> 35:17.680
I never did anything wrong.

35:25.160 --> 35:26.000
I hate him.

35:26.600 --> 35:28.600
I hate the entire Jiang family.

35:29.680 --> 35:31.320
Even in the netherworld,

35:32.560 --> 35:37.440
I would curse them all to a tragic end.

35:44.160 --> 35:49.000
- Jiang Li!
- Jiang Li!

35:49.080 --> 35:51.400
- Chancellor Jiang, you are truly blessed.
- Jiang Li!

35:51.480 --> 35:54.040
Your eldest legitimate daughter
has extraordinary grace!

35:54.680 --> 35:55.840
- Chancellor Jiang.
- Jiang Li!

35:55.920 --> 35:59.560
- Your daughter is unforgettable!
- Jiang Li!

35:59.640 --> 36:01.640
- Chancellor Jiang, I'm so lucky
- Jiang Li!

36:01.720 --> 36:03.600
- to meet your eldest daughter today!
- Jiang Li!

36:03.680 --> 36:04.760
- Such elegance
- Jiang Li!

36:04.840 --> 36:05.960
- is rarely seen!
- Jiang Li!

36:06.040 --> 36:07.920
- Azure robes frame her body.
- Jiang Li!

36:08.000 --> 36:10.120
The light green color
highlights her fair skin.

36:10.200 --> 36:12.160
- She is naturally charming and graceful!
- Jiang Li!

36:12.240 --> 36:16.280
- Jiang Li!
- Jiang Li!

36:16.360 --> 36:18.040
- Ms. Ruoyao!
- My lady!

36:18.120 --> 36:19.240
Ruoyao!

36:19.320 --> 36:20.800
- Ruoyao!
- Ms. Ruoyao!

36:20.880 --> 36:22.160
- Ruoyao, are you all right?
- Ms. Ruoyao!

36:22.240 --> 36:23.400
- What's wrong?
- Ruoyao!

36:23.480 --> 36:24.880
- What's going on?
- Get someone to check on her.

36:24.960 --> 36:25.800
My lady, are you all right?

36:25.880 --> 36:27.760
- Ruoyao!
- Ms. Ruoyao, wake up!

36:27.840 --> 36:29.400
- Ruoyao!
- Ms. Ruoyao, are you all right?

36:29.480 --> 36:30.640
- My lady!
- Ruoyao!

36:30.720 --> 36:32.680
Li'er, did you see that?

36:33.400 --> 36:35.080
This Hairpin Ceremony is my gift to you.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.840
Jiang Li.

37:08.440 --> 37:09.480
Thank you.

37:36.360 --> 37:38.680
- What should we do?
- What now?

37:38.760 --> 37:40.720
- What should we do?
- My goodness!

37:41.520 --> 37:43.120
- What should we do?
- Ruoyao.

37:43.200 --> 37:44.440
Ms. Ruoyao.

37:44.520 --> 37:45.920
- Quickly find a doctor!
- What should we do?

37:46.000 --> 37:47.640
- What should we do?
- My lord!

37:51.880 --> 37:53.600
JIANG RESIDENCE, AUSPICIOUS

37:53.680 --> 37:57.520
Mrs. Liu, thank you so much for today.

37:58.240 --> 37:59.920
There's no need for thanks between us.

38:00.000 --> 38:02.160
If you need anything in the future,
just let me know.

38:02.240 --> 38:03.080
All right.

38:04.040 --> 38:05.280
I will leave now.

38:10.480 --> 38:13.160
How did you let the Liu family
corner you like this?

38:14.120 --> 38:15.320
Father, are you asking me?

38:15.400 --> 38:16.920
I should ask you.

38:17.000 --> 38:19.080
When will our feud
with the Liu family ever end?

38:19.720 --> 38:21.200
At my daughter's Hairpin Ceremony,

38:21.680 --> 38:24.160
I was forced to bless Jiang Li instead.

38:24.240 --> 38:25.360
All right.

38:25.440 --> 38:27.080
It's just a Hairpin Ceremony.

38:27.960 --> 38:30.000
I noticed that Duke Su

38:30.080 --> 38:31.440
kept looking at Jiang Li earlier.

38:31.920 --> 38:33.880
Do you know when she got involved

38:33.960 --> 38:35.640
with the Duke Mansion?

38:37.760 --> 38:39.000
Father, have you forgotten

38:39.080 --> 38:40.920
half of Duke Su's ceremonial weapons?

38:42.160 --> 38:44.840
I can't let Jiang Li stay here.

39:13.120 --> 39:14.440
JIANG RESIDENCE

39:19.200 --> 39:20.040
Ms. Jiang Li.

39:20.920 --> 39:22.000
We meet again.

39:23.200 --> 39:25.080
You may already have forgotten,

39:26.000 --> 39:27.680
but we met at your doorstep last time

39:28.800 --> 39:29.760
and you…

39:34.440 --> 39:36.880
I didn't expect you to be Jiang Li.

39:37.360 --> 39:39.560
You have grown even more beautiful

39:40.040 --> 39:41.400
since our engagement when we were kids.

39:43.560 --> 39:44.400
Mr. Zhou.

39:44.960 --> 39:45.800
By the way,

39:47.320 --> 39:48.840
here's a small gift from me.

39:48.920 --> 39:50.320
I want to give it to you

39:50.400 --> 39:51.280
to make it up to you.

39:52.120 --> 39:53.080
Mr. Zhou.

39:53.760 --> 39:55.680
You're already engaged to Ruoyao.

39:56.320 --> 39:58.640
I should not accept your gift.

39:59.200 --> 40:00.600
Please give it to the right person.

40:01.080 --> 40:02.240
Mr. Zhou.

40:02.320 --> 40:03.200
This way, please.

40:19.880 --> 40:21.640
Why does Jiang Li

40:21.720 --> 40:23.120
look so much like Xue Fangfei?

40:24.600 --> 40:25.560
Yurong.

40:25.640 --> 40:28.280
- Has she returned from the dead?
- Shut up.

40:28.920 --> 40:30.280
In today's Hairpin Ceremony,

40:31.240 --> 40:33.560
the Jiang family clearly confirmed her
to be their daughter,

40:33.640 --> 40:35.680
so she's the Chancellor's daughter.

40:36.600 --> 40:39.920
The resemblance is just a coincidence.

40:40.920 --> 40:42.000
Be careful with your words

40:43.240 --> 40:44.320
or you'll get into trouble.

40:48.160 --> 40:49.200
Let's go.

41:02.000 --> 41:02.840
Mr. Shen.

41:26.280 --> 41:27.120
Mrs. Shen.

41:32.760 --> 41:33.720
Hurry up. Let's go.

42:09.920 --> 42:10.880
Ms. Jiang Li.

42:11.880 --> 42:13.160
What are you looking at?

42:35.120 --> 42:37.200
I thought I would miss this drama,

42:37.280 --> 42:38.720
but I didn't expect you

42:38.800 --> 42:40.480
to be so eloquent,

42:41.040 --> 42:43.600
forcing everyone into a corner.

42:44.160 --> 42:45.520
As for your cousin,

42:47.280 --> 42:49.480
he's a master of misdirection.

43:13.360 --> 43:14.840
- You're done for.
- It hurts so much!

43:14.920 --> 43:16.240
Why did you hit me?

43:17.440 --> 43:18.760
- It hurts!
- It hurts!

43:18.840 --> 43:20.000
You're finished.

43:20.480 --> 43:21.560
It was you!

43:24.440 --> 43:25.720
Don't go!

43:26.720 --> 43:28.080
How could you hit me and leave?

43:28.640 --> 43:30.200
- You can't escape.
- Come down!

43:30.720 --> 43:32.680
- Let go of me. Come down!
- How dare you hit me!

43:32.760 --> 43:33.600
Let go!

43:34.160 --> 43:35.280
Don't leave!

43:36.360 --> 43:38.000
Why did you come to the Jiang family?

43:38.560 --> 43:40.600
Duke Su, I don't understand
what you are asking.

43:44.160 --> 43:45.600
I thought the Jiang family

43:46.200 --> 43:48.960
had a proper and warm household.

43:49.040 --> 43:51.120
You coveted their warmth so much

43:51.200 --> 43:52.840
that you even schemed

43:53.320 --> 43:54.600
against me to return.

43:55.160 --> 43:56.240
Now, I see

43:56.800 --> 44:00.280
your situation with the Jiang family
isn't so great after all.

44:00.920 --> 44:03.440
The Jiang family is my home.

44:03.520 --> 44:05.040
Of course I must come back.

44:05.600 --> 44:08.640
Duke Su, you are meddling a bit too much.

44:08.720 --> 44:10.160
If I hadn't meddled so much,

44:11.120 --> 44:12.400
could you have returned?

44:16.480 --> 44:17.440
Tell me.

44:18.280 --> 44:19.560
How will you repay me?

44:23.160 --> 44:25.160
Duke Su, thank you
for bringing me back to the capital.

44:25.240 --> 44:26.360
However,

44:26.840 --> 44:28.800
I also helped you solve the case
in Qingcheng Mountain.

44:29.480 --> 44:30.920
I think I've repaid you.

44:31.480 --> 44:32.560
We are even now.

44:33.080 --> 44:35.960
I won't hold you accountable
for wrongfully accusing me either.

44:36.440 --> 44:38.960
Please also be kind

44:39.040 --> 44:40.320
and do not pursue this further.

44:42.520 --> 44:44.320
Now you reminded me.

44:45.520 --> 44:46.720
No one

44:47.240 --> 44:49.640
has ever called me brainless before.

44:51.760 --> 44:52.600
Jiang Li.

44:53.120 --> 44:54.880
How will we settle that score?

44:59.640 --> 45:00.960
Then call me names too.

45:04.600 --> 45:05.640
Since you don't want to,

45:06.680 --> 45:08.160
let's consider the matter closed.

45:08.840 --> 45:09.680
I'll go ahead.

45:11.280 --> 45:12.440
Xue Fangfei.

45:16.680 --> 45:18.000
Ms. Jiang Li, something happened.

